  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A small metal ball at the end of a rod is rotated anticlockwise in a vertical circle at constant speed. After a few revolutions, as the ball is moving upwards, it is released at the moment when the rod is horizontal.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the shape of the ball’s path after it is released from the rod?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">A circle</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">A semi-circle</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">A parabola</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">A straight line</li>\n</ol>"
  },
